[{"id":2720463175,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6iJvlH","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"The idea of this PR is welcome! Seems like a common enough pattern to support with some functional sugar.\r\nHowever, I prefer #100603's formulation over this one:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n// Original\r\nSpatial * my_obj = Object::cast_to<Spatial>(ObjectDB::get_instance(object_id));\r\n// #100603\r\nSpatial * my_obj = ObjectDB::get_instance<Spatial>(object_id);\r\n// This PR\r\nSpatial * my_obj = object_id.get_object<Type>();\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhile your formulation is shorter, in #100603's version it's clearer that it uses the `ClassDB`, which I think is very important to understand the code at a glance.\r\n\r\nAs for the `Ref` version, I'm more neutral on this being added since I like `Ref` creation being explicit. But I'd be OK with `ObjectDB::get_ref<Spatial>(object_id)`.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100602#pullrequestreview-2720463175","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100602","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-27T09:18:19Z"},{"id":2721665502,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6iOVHe","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Looks good to me. Thanks for indulging the interface change!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100602#pullrequestreview-2721665502","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100602","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-27T14:04:55Z"},{"id":2722009640,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6iPpIo","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100602#pullrequestreview-2722009640","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100602","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-27T14:43:35Z"},{"id":2722034270,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6iPvJe","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100602#pullrequestreview-2722034270","pul